{
  "id": "JHN.8",
  "number": "8",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Johana 8",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 59,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kiwa Jesus tulwetab Emitik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimus karon konyo hekalut, ak kibwa bik tugul ole mi inendet; ak kiteb ng’ony, konet ichek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiimut sirik ak Parisaik kobogoriot ne kiginamji ibetab ge; ak ye kingo kaginde kwenut, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kelenji, Konetindoni, kaginam kobogoriondoni eng’ ibetab ge, kota komi ibetab ge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King’atech Musa eng’ Ng’atutiet kole, kilage koik ne u nito: ara ilen nee inye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimwaei ng’olyondonito kotiemei inendet, si kosich kit ne kitaame. Ago kiing’uruk Jesu, kosir ng’ony eng’ mornennyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago ye kingota koteepse inendet, kotonon, ak kolenji, Ingotoi ne matinye tengek eng’ okwek kowir eng’ koita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiing’uruk kogeny kosir ng’ony eng’ mornennyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kingogas ichek ng’olyondonoto, komanda kobee agenge agenge, koboch ne o agoi ne bo let: ak king’et Jesu inegei, ak kobogoriondonoto eng’ ole kimi, kotononi eng’ kwen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotonon Jesu anyun, ak kolenji, Kobogoriondoni, mi ano ichek? Ma igikyin chi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile, Ma igikya chi, Kiptaiyandani. Ak kilenji Jesu, Magikyinin agane: ui anyun; koboch nguno, komatata iyai tengek.]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lapkeiyet ne bo ng’ony",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimwachi Jesu anyun ichek kogeny, kolenji, A lapkeiyet ne bo ng’ony: inendet ne isuba ko mawendoti eng’ mesundeito, ago nyoru lapkeiyetab sobondo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolenji anyun Parisaik inendet, Ibaorianjinige: ma bo iman baornateng’ung’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kowolji Jesu kolenji, Agot ngabaorianjinige, ko bo iman baornatennyu; amu angen ole abunu, ak ole awendi; ago mongen ole abunu, anan ole awendi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oruochi ko u magetab borto; maruokyini chi ane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, agot ngaruoch, ko bo iman kiruogennyu; amu mami anege, ago kimi ak Kwanda ne kiiyokwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee, ak kigisir eng’ Ng’atutieng’wong’ kele, bo iman baornatetab bik aeng’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A inendet ne abaorianjinige, ak baorianjina Kwanda ne kiiyokwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolenji anyun ichek inendet, Mi ano Kwandang’ung’? Kowol Jesu kole, Mongena, anan Baba: nda kigonaa, ta kiongen Baba agine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimwa inendet ng’alechu eng’ ole kigonore siling’isiek, ye kiinetisiei eng’ hekalut: ak ma nam chi inendet; amu kitom koit sainnyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kateunoik agobo betusiek che bwanei",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimwachi anyun icheget kogeny, kolenji, Awendi, ak tun ocheng’a, ak obegu eng’ tengektang’wong’: ole awendi, ko momuchi obwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kile anyun Yahudik, Tos bargei, amu mwaei kole, Ole awendi, ko momuchi obwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji, O bo oli bo ng’ony, a bo barak: o bo ng’onyuni; ma bo ane ng’onyuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noto kaamwawok, ale, obegu eng’ tengekwogikwok: amu ngo moyuani ole a inendet, obegu eng’ tengekwogikwok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilenji anyun ichek inendet, I ng’o? Kolenji Jesu, Noto kiamwawok koboch taunet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atinye tuguk che chang’ che amwae ak che aruochi agobo okwek: ago bo iman inendet ne kiiyokwa; ak amwachini ng’ony tuguk che kiagas eng’ inendet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago ma iguiyo kole mwachin agobo Kwanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilenji Jesu anyun, Ye kaouite Weritab chi, onai anyun eng’ betunoto ole a inendet, amayae kiy anege, ago amwae tuguchu ko u ye kiineta Kwanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimi tuwai ak inendet ne kiiyokwa; ma bagakta anege; amu ayae kotugul tuguchoto chamaksei eng’ inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kita komwaei tuguchu, koyan inendet che chang’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng’alek che kiting’e Jesu Yahudik",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilenji Jesu anyun Yahudichoto kiga koyan inendet, Ngot otebye okwek eng’ ng’olyondennyu, ko o alamalyennyu iman; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak onai imanda, ak kotiachak imanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kowolji ichek inendet kolenji, Ki keswekab Abraham, ak tom keegu otwogikab chi age tugul ole kinye kora: imwaitoi ano anyun ile, Kitiachok? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kowolji Jesu kolenji, Amwawok, iman, iman, ale, Age tugul ne yaei tengek ko otwogindetab tengek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak matebyei otwogindet eng’ got koigeny: tebyei werit koigeny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngotiachak anyun Werit, ko otiagotin iman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angen ale o keswekab Abraham; ago ocheng’e obara, amu matinyei ng’olyondennyu ole tebe eng’ okwek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amwae tuguk che kiageer eng’ Baba: ak oyae tuguchoto kiogas eng’ kwandang’wong’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kowolji kolenji, Kwandanyo ko Abraham. Kolenji Jesu, Nda kio lagokab Abraham, ta kioyae boisiosiekab Abraham. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago ngo ocheng’e obara, chito ne kamwawok ng’alek che bo iman, che kiagas eng’ Jehovah: kima yai ko u noto Abraham. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyae boisionik che bo kwandang’wong’. Kilenji anyun inendet, Kima kisichech eng’ sokset; kitinye Kwanda agenge, noto ko Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komwachi Jesu ichek kolenji, Nda ka Kwandang’wong’ Jehovah, ta kaochama: amu kianyo abunu Jehovah; kima anyo anege, ago kiiyokwa inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu nee si monai choto amwae? Amu momuchi ogas ng’olyondennyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O bo kwandang’wong’ oindet, ak ochame oyai magutikab kwandang’wong’. Ki rumindet koboch taunet, ama tononi eng’ imanit, amu mami imanit eng’ inendet. Ye mwaei lembech, komwaei agobo tugukyik: amu kiplembechwa inendet, ak kwanda ne bo noto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago moyana amu amwae imanit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’o eng’ okwek ne igikyina kole atinye tengek? Ngot amwae imanit, ko amu nee anyun si moyana? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inendet ne bo Jehovah kogasei ng’alekab Jehovah: noto anyun mogase okwek, amu mobo Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kowolji anyun Yahudik kolenji, Magimwae achek iman kele, I Samarindet, ak itinye oindet? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kowol Jesu kole, Matinye oindet; ago agonyiti Baba, ak otewera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago macheng’e torornatennyu: mitei agenge ne cheng’ei ak koruochi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amwawok, iman, iman, ale, Ngo rib chi ng’olyondennyu ko mageerei meet agoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolenji anyun Yahudik, Kingen nguno kele itinye oindet. Kigome Abraham, ak kigobek maotik; ak imwae ile, Ngo rib chi ng’olyondennyu, ko machamjami meet agoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tos i o isiir kwandanyo Abraham, ne kigome? Ak kigobek maotik: iyaege iegu ng’o? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kowol Jesu kole, Ngot atororige, ko buch torornatannyu: Kwandanyu ne itorora; ne omwae ole, inendet ko Jehovah neng’wong’; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak tom onai inendet: ago angen inendet; ak ngot amwa ale, mangen inendet, aegu kiplembechwa, ko u okwek: ago angen inendet, ak aribe ng’olyondennyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kibaibai kwandang’wong’ Abraham kogeer betunnyu; ak kigeer, ak kogasgei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolenji Yahudik anyun, Tom iit kenyisiek konom, ak kiigeer Abraham? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolenji Jesu, Amwawok, iman, iman, ale, Kingotom kobiit Abraham, ami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 8:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiinem anyun koik komachei kowire inendet: ago kiung’gei Jesu, ak komanda eng’ hekalut.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.8.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.8.59"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
